The archives' names should end with the extension ".tgz" and can be in subdirectories of the input directory.
For example, the following is a valid structure for the input directory:

```
├── campaign-0
│   └── meringue.tgz
├── campaign-1
│   └── meringue.tgz
└── campaign-2
